'''Nibblers, Begone!''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to kill [[TzKal-Zuk]] while not letting any of the three [[rocky support|pillars]] that are provided at the start of the fight be destroyed by the [[Jal-Nib]]s.

